{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53127","headline":"龙虎元旨歌 七 · 青霞子","name":"龙虎元旨歌 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此宝从来二八传，吉年吉月入炉安。\n千朝火候依时节，必定芽成汞已乾。\n（按：《龙虎元旨》末云：「东岳董师元於贞元五年受之於罗浮山隐士青霞子，贞元十九年传受剑州司马张陶，开成三年京师传族弟汾，成长契五年传成君。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"青霞子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}